                        "entry_id": "c7570ff4-84ff-31c7-a3ed-980dae46bc69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An act of rolling out; gradual deployment."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e82fbf00-4c61-4f33-a957-4158627829bc",
                                "sense_id": "22e1d927-b450-3adb-9235-93c95093f717",
                                "text": "The growing use of social media to spread anger and dissent in the Arab world has been hailed by western governments as one of the chief justifications for a completely unfettered internet. The US is reportedly funding the secret rollout of technology in Iran in an effort to undermine internet censors in the country."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5d7a226f-6adc-4f48-933e-42e80d057cc0",
                                "sense_id": "22e1d927-b450-3adb-9235-93c95093f717",
                                "text": "They were also impressed with the speed of the rollout, considering that the idea was only realised once the pandemic took hold."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b4b86cc0-3e22-3490-8fd5-a249dc34229d",
                        "entry_id": "c7570ff4-84ff-31c7-a3ed-980dae46bc69",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The phase of a landing after touchdown but before the aircraft slows to taxi speed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
